0,Gbaya people - Wikipedia,https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gbaya_people,"The Gbaya, also Gbeya or Baya, are a people of the western region of the Central African Republic, east-central Cameroon, the north of the Republic of Congo, the northwest of the Democratic Republic of Congo, and South Sudan. [4] In the first half of the 20th century, the Gbaya were involved in several revolt attempts against German and then French colonial rule. In rural areas, the Gbaya ...","Gbaya, Northwest",Niger-Congo
